  {t="Lar'korwi Mates and the raft", lv=49, n="The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it.", g={{"o",4291,i=1,txt="Ravasaur Pheromone Gland x2",m=1449,x=67,y=73},{"a",3844,m=1449,x=63,y=68.6,ml=47},{"t",3844,n2="A Small Pack, underwater",m=1449,x=63.1,y=69.1},{"a",3845,m=1449,x=63.1,y=69.1,ml=47},{"o",3845,i=1,txt="Large Compass",m=1449,x=63.1,y=69.1},{"o",3845,i=2,txt="Curled Map Parchment",m=1449,x=63.1,y=69.1},{"o",3845,i=3,txt="Lion-headed Key",m=1449,x=63.1,y=69.1},{"h",11116,txt="Get A Mangled Journal",m=1449,x=62.9,y=66.7,n=1,opt=true},{"a",3884,opt=true,ml=48}}},
