  {t="The Super Snapper FX", lv=50, n="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gammerita (level 48 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nGammerita walks the Hinterlands shore below the Overlook Cliffs, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore.", w={{k="group",q=2944}}, g={{"o",2944,i=1,txt="Snapshot of Gammerita",m=1425,x=80.4,y=58.2,grp=true},{"o",2944,i=1,txt="Use Super Snapper FX",m=1425,x=80.4,y=58.2}}},
