  {t="Sorrow Hill: kill these as you meet them", lv=50, n="Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.\nCareful: The Eye of Naxxramas (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts.", g={{"o",5092,i=1,txt="Kill Skeletal Flayer x10",m=1422,x=47.4,y=84.3},{"o",5092,i=2,txt="Kill Slavering Ghoul x10",m=1422,x=49.6,y=82.8}}},
