  {t="Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them", lv=52, n="The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered.\nRead the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript.\nUse the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.", g={{"o",3701,i=1,txt="Thaurissan Relic",m=1428,x=65.3,y=34.8},{"o",4726,i=1,txt="Broodling Essence x8",m=1428,x=61.1,y=31.2},{"o",4283,i=1,txt="Blackrock Medallion x50",m=1428,x=75.5,y=32.9},{"o",4726,i=1,txt="Use Draco-Incarcinatrix 900",m=1428,x=72.4,y=28.2},{"o",4296,i=1,txt="Tablet Transcript",m=1428,x=54.1,y=40.8}}},
