  {t="A Taste of Flame", lv=52, n="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Frenzied Black Drake is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.", w={{k="turnedin",neg=true,q=3481},{k="group",q=4023}}, g={{"o",4023,i=1,txt="Black Dragonflight Molt",m=1428,x=94.4,y=31.8}}},
