  {t="Blackrock Stronghold", lv=52, n="Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty.\nCareful: Gor'tesh has a guard linked to him that joins the fight, and a second soldier patrols close by; clear the patrol before pulling.", g={{"o",4283,i=1,txt="Blackrock Medallion x50",n2="Blackrock Medallion; inside",m=1428,x=89.3,y=50.6},{"o",3824,i=1,txt="Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head",m=1428,x=39.3,y=55.3}}},
