  {t="Radley and Durgen", lv=56, n="Huntsman Radley walks the Northridge camp east of Kirsta; Cavalier Durgen guards the tower at Hearthglen's southern approach.\nCareful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight.", g={{"o",6023,i=1,txt="Kill Huntsman Radley",m=1422,x=57.8,y=36.1},{"o",6023,i=2,txt="Kill Cavalier Durgen",m=1422,x=55.1,y=23.6}}},
