  {t="Elwynn Forest: kill these as you meet them", lv=6, n="Overgrown Duskweed grows in the fields around the vineyards and the Stonefield farm; Stonetusk Boars around them give the blood.\nStonetusk Boars graze between the vineyards and the farm.", g={{"o",99130,i=1,txt="Vial of Animal Blood x6",n2="Vial of Animal Blood: Stonetusk Boars",m=1429,x=42.9,y=86.6},{"o",99130,i=2,txt="Duskweed Petal x18",m=1429,x=43.3,y=87},{"o",86,i=1,txt="Chunk of Boar Meat x4",n2="Chunks of Boar Meat",m=1429,x=42.9,y=86.6}}},
  {t="\"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield", lv=6, g={{"t",86,m=1429,x=34.5,y=84.2},{"a",84,m=1429,x=34.5,y=84.2,ml=5}}},
  {t="Billy Maclure", lv=6, g={{"t",84,m=1429,x=43.1,y=85.7},{"a",87,m=1429,x=43.1,y=85.7,ml=5}}},
  {t="The Maclure Vineyards: kill these as you meet them", lv=6, n="The mine is west of the vineyards. Kobold Miners and Tunnelers fill both levels; Nimsy, a named kobold, holds the picture book in the lower tunnels. Nimsy is elite: grouping up is advised.", g={{"o",99130,i=2,txt="Duskweed Petal x18",m=1429,x=43.3,y=87},{"c",62,txt="Scout through the Fargodeep Mine",n2="Walk through the mine",m=1429,x=40.6,y=82.3},{"o",60,i=1,txt="Large Candle x8",n2="Large Candles",m=1429,x=40.3,y=82.5},{"o",47,i=1,txt="Gold Dust x10",m=1429,x=40.3,y=82.5}}},
  {t="The Maclure Vineyards: kill these as you meet them", lv=6, n="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Nimsy (level 6 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.", w={{k="group",q=91775}}, g={{"o",91775,i=2,txt="Lost Book x6",n2="Lost Books: Kobold Miners and Tunnelers",m=1429,x=40.3,y=82.5,grp=true},{"o",91775,i=1,txt="Picture Book: Fun with Elementals",n2="Fun with Elementals: Nimsy",m=1429,x=41.6,y=79.9,grp=true}}},
  {t="Goldtooth", lv=8, n="Goldtooth is inside the Fargodeep Mine, not on the hill above it: go in at the mouth and keep left to the back of the mine floor; don't take the stairs up. Defias Bandits around the vineyards drop a Westfall Deed now and then: right-click it.\nCareful: Nimsy (6), a kobold deep in the mine, is elite, and Narg the Taskmaster (10, rare) walks the tunnels: pull the kobolds one at a time.", g={{"g",0,txt="Fargodeep Mine",m=1429,x=39.5,y=82.4},{"o",87,i=1,txt="Bernice's Necklace",n2="Bernice's Necklace; below ground",m=1429,x=41.7,y=78},{"h",1972,txt="Get Westfall Deed",m=1429,x=44.4,y=74.9,n=1,opt=true},{"a",184,opt=true,ml=8}}},
  {t="Goldshire", lv=8, n="Priestess Josetta (priests), Zaldimar Wefhellt (mages) and Keryn Sylvius (rogues) stand upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.", g={{"t",47,m=1429,x=42.1,y=67.3},{"t",99130,m=1429,x=42.1,y=67.3},{"a",99131,m=1429,x=42.1,y=67.3,ml=4},{"a",40,m=1429,x=42.1,y=67.3,ml=7},{"t",40,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9},{"a",35,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9,ml=7},{"t",62,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9},{"a",76,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9,ml=4},{"t",60,n2="William Pestle, inside",m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7},{"a",61,n2="Morgan Pestle in Stormwind takes it (02-westfall)",m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7,ml=3},{"t",107,m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7},{"a",112,m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7,ml=5},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer"}}},
  {t="Goldshire", lv=8, w={{k="group",q=91775}}, g={{"t",91775,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9}}},
  {t="Level 8.39", lv=8, n="If you skipped Book Return, grind here to level 8.39 to stay on the route's plan.", w={{k="group",neg=true,q=91775},{k="level",op="<",n=8,frac=0.39}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Kobold Miner",m=1429,x=41.7,y=78},{"l",8,txt="Reach level 8 (39% in): grind Kobold Miner",n2="grind on Kobold Miner",m=1429,x=41.7,y=78.7,fr=0.39}}},
  {t="Class trainer", lv=8, f={c={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",f={c={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK"}}}}},
  {t="Shaman trainer", lv=8, f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Teo Hammerstorm in Dun Morogh; Goldshire has no shaman trainer",f={c={"SHAMAN"}}}}},
  {t="Druid trainer", lv=8, f={c={"DRUID"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind City; Goldshire has no druid trainer",f={c={"DRUID"}}}}},
  {t="Jason Mathers", lv=8, n="Head east out of Goldshire along the lake shore. Jason Mathers stands on the shore north-east of town.", g={{"t",99131,m=1429,x=47.5,y=62.2}}},
  {t="Crystal Lake: kill these as you meet them", lv=8, n="The murlocs on the east shore drop the kelp. Skinners: Gray Forest Wolves roam the woods between the lake and the Tower of Azora; Prowlers further east give pelts too.", g={{"o",112,i=1,txt="Crystal Kelp Frond x4",n2="Crystal Kelp Fronds",m=1429,x=50.5,y=62.3},{"o",91751,i=1,txt="Rough Wolf Pelt x7",n2="Rough Wolf Pelts",m=1429,x=58.4,y=62.1,opt=true}}},
  {t="The Tower of Azora", lv=8, n="Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower.", g={{"a",91725,m=1429,x=63.2,y=72.6,ml=7},{"a",91723,m=1429,x=65.1,y=69.8,ml=7}}},
  {t="The bridge", lv=8, n="Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it.", g={{"t",35,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2},{"a",37,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2,ml=7},{"a",52,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2,ml=7},{"a",91733,m=1429,x=76.5,y=71.9,ml=7}}},
  {t="Downstream and Princess", lv=8, n="The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way. Careful: Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore. Only go for his head with a group or once you're level 10; otherwise leave him: it's optional.", g={{"o",91733,i=2,txt="Waterlogged Saw",m=1429,x=74.5,y=76.4},{"o",52,i=1,txt="Kill Prowler x8",m=1429,x=75.5,y=76.5},{"o",52,i=2,txt="Kill Young Forest Bear x5",m=1429,x=73.4,y=80.4},{"o",88,i=1,txt="Brass Collar",n2="Brass Collar: Princess",m=1429,x=69.7,y=79.2},{"o",91733,i=3,txt="Waterlogged Toolbox",m=1429,x=77.3,y=86.7},{"o",91733,i=1,txt="Waterlogged Axe",m=1429,x=76.7,y=82.4}}},
  {t="Croaky", lv=8, n="Croaky is a level 11 elite on the murloc shore south of the bridge: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Croaky's Head needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back. Right-click the head for its quest.", w={{k="group",q=91740}}, g={{"h",247826,txt="Get Croaky's Head",n2="Croaky's Head: Croaky",m=1429,x=76.7,y=82.7,n=1,grp=true},{"a",91740,opt=true,ml=7}}},
  {t="Ridgepoint Tower", lv=8, w={{k="group",q=91740}}, g={{"t",91740,m=1429,x=84.8,y=79.3}}},
  {t="Level 8.85", lv=8, n="If you skipped Croaky's Head, grind here to level 8.85 to stay on the route's plan.", w={{k="group",neg=true,q=91740},{k="level",op="<",n=8,frac=0.85}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Prowler",m=1429,x=78.1,y=62.1},{"l",8,txt="Reach level 8 (85% in): grind Prowler",n2="grind on Prowler",m=1429,x=78.4,y=62.7,fr=0.85}}},
  {t="Ormin Pelford", lv=8, g={{"t",91733,m=1429,x=76.5,y=71.9}}},
  {t="The Eastvale Logging Camp", lv=8, n="The camp is north-east of the bridge. Bundles of Wood lie around the camp and in the woods north of it.", g={{"a",83,n2="Sara Timberlain, inside",m=1429,x=79.5,y=68.8,ml=4},{"a",5545,m=1429,x=81.4,y=66.1,ml=5},{"a",91732,m=1429,x=82.5,y=63.8,ml=6},{"o",5545,i=1,txt="Bundle of Wood x8",m=1429,x=81.6,y=62.6},{"t",5545,m=1429,x=81.4,y=66.1}}},
  {t="A half-eaten body", lv=8, n="It lies by the river north-west of the logging camp.", g={{"t",37,m=1429,x=72.7,y=60.3},{"a",45,m=1429,x=72.7,y=60.3,ml=7}}},
  {t="Stone Cairn Lake", lv=8, n="Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of Stone Cairn Lake; they drop the Red Linen Bandanas too. Rolf's corpse lies in the murloc village on the north-east shore.", g={{"o",83,i=1,txt="Red Linen Bandana x6",n2="Red Linen Bandanas",m=1429,x=72.5,y=56.4},{"t",45,m=1429,x=79.8,y=55.5},{"a",71,m=1429,x=79.8,y=55.5,ml=7}}},
  {t="The gnoll camps", lv=8, n="Riverpaw gnolls camp in the hills west of Stone Cairn Lake; the Stolen Enchanting Supplies lie in their camps.", g={{"o",91725,i=1,txt="Stolen Enchanting Supplies x5",m=1429,x=68.7,y=51.1}}},
  {t="The Jasperlode Mine's entrance", lv=8, g={{"g",0,txt="Jasperlode Mine",m=1429,x=61.6,y=54.1}}},
  {t="Jasperlode Mine: kill these as you meet them", lv=8, n="The mine is south-west of the gnoll camps. Mining Tools lie near the entrance; Kobold Geomancers hold the tunnels.\nCareful: Mother Fang (7-10), the Mine Spiders (7-9) and Geosculptor Yip (7) are elites deep in the mine: pull the kobolds one at a time near the entrance and back out if an elite comes; they're easier with a friend.", g={{"o",91732,i=1,txt="Mining Tools x4",m=1429,x=61.6,y=53.3},{"c",76,txt="Scout through the Jasperlode Mine",n2="Walk into the mine",m=1429,x=60.2,y=49.2},{"o",91723,i=1,txt="Kill Kobold Geomancer x8",n2="Kobold Geomancer walks around Jasperlode Mine: look inside the circle on the map",m=1429,x=61.1,y=49.3}}},
  {t="The Tower of Azora", lv=8, n="Follow the hills south to the tower.", g={{"t",91723,m=1429,x=65.1,y=69.8},{"a",91724,m=1429,x=65.1,y=69.8,ml=6},{"t",91725,m=1429,x=63.2,y=72.6}}},
  {t="Guard Thomas", lv=8, n="Follow the road east past the Tower of Azora to the bridge. Finish the Prowlers and Young Forest Bears around the river south of it.", g={{"t",71,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2},{"a",39,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2,ml=7},{"o",52,i=1,txt="Kill Prowler x8",m=1429,x=75.5,y=76.5},{"t",52,m=1429,x=74,y=72.2}}},
  {t="The Eastvale Logging Camp", lv=8, g={{"t",83,n2="Inside",m=1429,x=79.5,y=68.8},{"t",91732,m=1429,x=82.5,y=63.8}}},
  {t="Stone Cairn Lake", lv=8, n="North-east of the logging camp. Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of the lake.", g={{"o",91724,i=1,txt="Kill Defias Rogue Wizard x8",m=1429,x=76.6,y=53.4}}},
  {t="The Tower of Azora", lv=8, n="Follow the hills south to the tower, on the road west.", g={{"t",91724,m=1429,x=65.1,y=69.8}}},
  {t="Goldshire", lv=10, n="Follow the road west back to Goldshire; Helene stands on the lake shore before town. Priestess Josetta (priests), Zaldimar Wefhellt (mages) and Keryn Sylvius (rogues) stand upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.", g={{"t",91751,n2="Helene Peltskinner, inside",m=1429,x=46.2,y=62.2,opt=true},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer"},{"t",112,n2="William Pestle, inside",m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7},{"t",39,n2="Marshal Dughan, while William brews",m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9},{"t",76,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9},{"a",239,m=1429,x=42.1,y=65.9,ml=6},{"a",1097,n2="Smith Argus, at the smithy beside Dughan: Grimand Elmore in Stormwind takes it (02-westfall)",m=1429,x=41.7,y=65.5,ml=9},{"a",114,n2="William Pestle, back in the inn",m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7,ml=5},{"a",94774,n2="Priestess Josetta: High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind takes it",m=1429,x=43.3,y=65.7,f={c={"PRIEST"}},ml=10},{"a",1860,n2="Zaldimar Wefhellt: Jennea Cannon in Stormwind takes it",m=1429,x=43.2,y=66.2,f={c={"MAGE"}},ml=10},{"a",94792,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2,f={c={"HUNTER"}},ml=10},{"a",1685,n2="Remen Marcot: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it",m=1429,x=44.5,y=66.3,f={c={"WARLOCK"}},ml=10}}},
  {t="Stormwind City", lv=10, f={c={"MAGE"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Jennea Cannon",m=1453,x=49.5,y=85.8}}},
  {t="Jennea Cannon", lv=10, n="Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter; she gives you a flask for the Mirror Lake waterfall.", f={c={"MAGE"}}, g={{"t",1860,m=1453,x=49.6,y=85.8},{"a",1861,m=1453,x=49.6,y=85.8,ml=10}}},
  {t="Stormwind City", lv=10, f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Gakin the Darkbinder",m=1453,x=39.3,y=85.3}}},
  {t="Gakin the Darkbinder", lv=10, n="Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"t",1685,m=1453,x=39.2,y=85.2},{"a",1688,m=1453,x=39.2,y=85.2,ml=10}}},
  {t="Woo Ping", lv=10, n="While you're here: learn Staves from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); a staff carries more spell stats than a one-hander while you level.", w={{k="money",op=">=",n=1000},{k="skill",neg=true,n=1,name="Staves",skillLine=136}}, f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Train with Woo Ping",m=1453,x=63.9,y=69.1}}},
  {t="Mirror Lake", lv=10, n="Leave Stormwind by the main gate. The Mirror Lake waterfall is south-west of the gates, on the way west to Westfall: fill Jennea's Flask at its base.", f={c={"MAGE"}}, g={{"o",1861,i=1,txt="Mirror Lake Water Sample",m=1429,x=28.6,y=61.4}}},
  {t="Surena Caledon", lv=10, n="Head back out through Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"o",1688,i=1,txt="Surena's Choker",n2="Surena's Choker: Surena Caledon",m=1429,x=71,y=80.8}}},
  {t="The Binding", lv=10, n="Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"t",1688,m=1453,x=39.2,y=85.2},{"a",1689,m=1453,x=39.2,y=85.2,ml=10},{"c",1689,txt="Summoned Voidwalker",n2="Subdue the voidwalker"},{"t",1689,n2="Summon Voidwalker",m=1453,x=39.2,y=85.2}}},
  {t="Back to Elwynn Forest", lv=10, f={c={"MAGE","WARLOCK"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Goldshire",m=1429,x=42.2,y=70.5}}},
  {t="Taming the Beast", lv=10, n="Josephine Carson stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake.", f={c={"HUNTER"}}, g={{"o",94792,i=1,txt="Tame Rockhide Boar",n2="Rockhide Boar: tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1429,x=43.3,y=77.9},{"t",94792,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2},{"a",94863,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2,ml=10},{"o",94863,i=1,txt="Tame Gray Forest Wolf",n2="Gray Forest Wolf: tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1429,x=58.4,y=62.1},{"t",94863,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2},{"a",94864,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2,ml=10},{"o",94864,i=1,txt="Tame Young Forest Bear",n2="Young Forest Bear: tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1429,x=43.4,y=80.4},{"t",94864,n2="Tame Beast",m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2},{"a",94793,m=1429,x=41.1,y=66.2,ml=10},{"t",94793,n2="Isaac Chan, beside her: Beast Training",m=1429,x=41.8,y=66.4}}},
  {t="Maybell Maclure", lv=10, n="South down the road to the Maclure Vineyards.", g={{"t",114,n2="Inside",m=1429,x=43.1,y=89.6}}},
  {t="The Stonefield Farm", lv=10, n="Homer Stonefield sells the Shiny Red Apples for the Applejack Still. Apples looted from kobolds and crates count too: the purchase ticks itself once you have four.", g={{"t",88,m=1429,x=34.7,y=84.5},{"t",87,m=1429,x=34.5,y=84.2},{"h",4536,txt="Buy Shiny Red Apple x4 (Homer Stonefield)",n2="Shiny Red Apples, from Homer Stonefield, for the Applejack Still",m=1429,x=33.7,y=82.9,n=4}}},
  {t="The Applejack Still", lv=10, n="The Applejack Still stands north of the Westbrook Garrison. Click it with four Shiny Red Apples in your bags: it takes them and gives you a Thunder Applejack on the spot (the quest never shows in your quest log). Keep the Applejack for Sergeant De Vries: don't drink it.", g={{"a",91736,m=1429,x=24.6,y=58,opt=true,ml=1},{"t",91736,m=1429,x=24.6,y=58,opt=true},{"h",247824,txt="Get Thunder Applejack",n2="Thunder Applejack, from the still",m=1429,x=24.6,y=58,n=1}}},
  {t="Westbrook Garrison", lv=10, n="Follow the road south to the Westbrook Garrison, on the way into Westfall. Deputy Rainer stands outside the barracks; Sergeant De Vries stands inside. He has An Apple Treat only while you carry the Thunder Applejack: talk to him and it goes straight to the hand-in.", g={{"t",239,m=1429,x=24.2,y=74.5},{"a",109,n2="Deputy Rainer: for Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill",m=1429,x=24.2,y=74.5,ml=9},{"a",11,m=1429,x=24.2,y=74.5,ml=6},{"a",91738,n2="Sergeant De Vries: he wants your Thunder Applejack; inside",m=1429,x=24.1,y=73.2,ml=7},{"t",91738,m=1429,x=24.1,y=73.2}}},
  {t="Forest's Edge", lv=10, n="Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners hold the hills south of the garrison, along the Westfall border.", g={{"o",11,i=1,txt="Painted Gnoll Armband x8",n2="Painted Gnoll Armbands",m=1429,x=27.4,y=79.9}}},
  {t="Westbrook Garrison", lv=10, g={{"t",11,m=1429,x=24.2,y=74.5}}},
} end)

R:Segment({id="alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil",title="Teldrassil",faction="Alliance",races={"NightElf"},min=1,max=12,zone=1438,zoneName="Teldrassil",next="alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore"}, function() return {
  {t="Aldrassil", lv=1, n="You start at the foot of Aldrassil, the great tree of Shadowglen.", g={{"a",456,m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,ml=1},{"a",458,n2="Melithar Staghelm, by the path",m=1438,x=59.9,y=42.5,ml=1},{"t",458,n2="Tarindrella, south of the tree",m=1438,x=57.8,y=45.2},{"a",459,m=1438,x=57.8,y=45.2,ml=1},{"a",97977,m=1438,x=57.8,y=45.2,ml=1}}},
  {t="Shadowglen: kill these as you meet them", lv=1, n="Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars roam around Aldrassil. Grells carry Fel Moss in the woods west of the tree, where the Gnarlpine Totems stand.", g={{"o",456,i=1,txt="Kill Young Nightsaber x7",m=1438,x=57.9,y=44.7},{"o",456,i=2,txt="Kill Young Thistle Boar x4",m=1438,x=57.4,y=45},{"o",459,i=1,txt="Fel Moss x8",m=1438,x=56.2,y=45.8},{"o",97977,i=1,txt="Gnarlpine Totem x4",m=1438,x=56,y=46.1}}},
  {t="Back at Aldrassil", lv=3, g={{"t",459,m=1438,x=57.8,y=45.2},{"t",97977,m=1438,x=57.8,y=45.2},{"t",456,m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3},{"a",457,m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,ml=1},{"a",3116,n2="Conservator Ilthalaine: Simple Sigil",m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,f={c={"WARRIOR"}},ml=1},{"a",3117,n2="Conservator Ilthalaine: a sigil for Ayanna Everstride",m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,f={c={"HUNTER"}},ml=1},{"a",3118,n2="Conservator Ilthalaine: Encrypted Sigil",m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,f={c={"ROGUE"}},ml=1},{"a",3119,n2="Conservator Ilthalaine: Hallowed Sigil",m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,f={c={"PRIEST"}},ml=1},{"a",3120,n2="Conservator Ilthalaine: Verdant Sigil",m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3,f={c={"DRUID"}},ml=1},{"a",916,n2="Gilshalan Windwalker, on the tree's ramp",m=1438,x=57.8,y=41.6,ml=3},{"a",97979,n2="Shanda: in at the tree's front entrance and up the ramp; upstairs",m=1438,x=59.2,y=40.4,ml=1},{"i",0,txt="The Goddess Provides: cast Elune's Light and Shadowmeld, then hand it back to Shanda"},{"t",97979,m=1438,x=59.2,y=40.4},{"a",4495,n2="Dirania Silvershine, east of the tree",m=1438,x=60.9,y=42,ml=2}}},
  {t="North to Shadowthread Cave", lv=3, n="Mangy Nightsabers and Thistle Boars roam north of Aldrassil, on the way to the cave. Githyiss the Vile sits deep inside. Iverron waits in the trees west of the cave mouth.", g={{"o",457,i=1,txt="Kill Mangy Nightsaber x7",m=1438,x=61.2,y=39.1},{"o",457,i=2,txt="Kill Thistle Boar x7",m=1438,x=61.8,y=38.6},{"o",916,i=1,txt="Webwood Venom Sac x10",n2="Webwood Spiders; below ground",m=1438,x=58.8,y=33.4},{"t",4495,m=1438,x=54.6,y=33},{"a",3519,m=1438,x=54.6,y=33,ml=2}}},
  {t="Aldrassil", lv=3, n="The trainers stand upstairs inside Aldrassil, along the ramp that winds up the tree: Alyissia and Frahun Shadewhisper on the first level, Shanda above them, Ayanna Everstride and Mardant Strongoak at the top. The arrow cannot tell the levels apart.", g={{"t",916,m=1438,x=57.8,y=41.6},{"a",917,m=1438,x=57.8,y=41.6,ml=1},{"t",457,m=1438,x=58.7,y=44.3},{"t",3519,m=1438,x=60.9,y=42},{"a",3521,m=1438,x=60.9,y=42,ml=2},{"t",3116,n2="Alyissia, the warrior trainer; inside",m=1438,x=59.6,y=38.4,f={c={"WARRIOR"}}},{"t",3117,n2="Ayanna Everstride, the hunter trainer",m=1438,x=58.7,y=40.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}}},{"t",3118,n2="Frahun Shadewhisper, the rogue trainer",m=1438,x=59.6,y=38.7,f={c={"ROGUE"}}},{"t",3119,n2="Shanda, the priest trainer: in at the tree's front entrance and up the ramp",m=1438,x=59.2,y=40.4,f={c={"PRIEST"}}},{"t",3120,n2="Mardant Strongoak, the druid trainer at Aldrassil",m=1438,x=58.6,y=40.3,f={c={"DRUID"}}},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer"}}},
  {t="Webwood Egg and the antidote", lv=3, n="The Webwood Eggs lie at the back of Shadowthread Cave: take the central path, then left where it splits, up to the high ledge. Hyacinth Mushrooms drop from Grells, Moonpetal Lilies grow by the ponds north of Aldrassil.", g={{"o",3521,i=1,txt="Hyacinth Mushroom x7",n2="Grells",m=1438,x=58.6,y=41.5},{"o",3521,i=2,txt="Moonpetal Lily x4",m=1438,x=57.3,y=39.7}}},
